        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CF3014  Modern Appliance Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary designed appliance door pull is constructed of durable non rusting aluminum and finished  in your choice of Satin Nickel or Polished Chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions CF3014/xx Modern Appliance Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Non Rusting Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Lengths</b> of this Modern Appliance Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-CF3014/400: Total Length 15-3/4\" (400mm) - Center to Center Mount  15-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF3014/600: Total Length 23-5/8\" (600mm) - Center to Center Mount  23\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These Modern Design Appliance Pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**This Item is Discontinued.</b> See other available <a href=\"/collections/appliance-pulls\"><b>Appliance Pulls</b></a> \r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
